# e2e suite and its output: dev-only, never part of the Cloud Run image.
# (Playwright itself is a devDependency, which `npm install --omit=dev`
# in the Dockerfile already skips.) Except the recorded model replies: a
# preview with E2E_REPLAY=1 answers test families from them
# (server/model-replay.js); without that env (production) they're never read.
tests/**
!tests/e2e/recordings/**
